1
00:00:02,008 --> 00:00:04,388
Book seven is Persepolis Rising.

2
00:00:04,408 --> 00:00:06,413
Nearly thirty years have passed.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:07,638
The Transport Union,

4
00:00:07,658 --> 00:00:09,178
led by Camina Drummer,

5
00:00:09,198 --> 00:00:10,653
runs the gates.

6
00:00:10,673 --> 00:00:12,628
Holden and Naomi are getting ready

7
00:00:12,648 --> 00:00:15,853
to retire and hand the Rocinante to Bobbie.

8
00:00:15,873 --> 00:00:16,853
Then the hidden world

9
00:00:16,873 --> 00:00:19,278
of Laconia comes out of the dark.

10
00:00:19,298 --> 00:00:21,928
Three stories: the fall of Medina,

11
00:00:21,948 --> 00:00:25,253
Drummer's surrender, and the Rocinante underground.

12
00:00:25,273 --> 00:00:26,577
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:27,341 --> 00:00:29,221
Story one: Medina.

14
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:31,071
Without warning, a ship comes through

15
00:00:31,091 --> 00:00:32,621
the Laconia gate.

16
00:00:32,641 --> 00:00:34,771
It is the Heart of the Tempest,

17
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:37,646
a battleship built by alien machines.

18
00:00:37,666 --> 00:00:40,671
Its magnetic weapon tears Medina's rail guns

19
00:00:40,691 --> 00:00:42,771
apart from far away.

20
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:45,196
The station that controls the Ring falls

21
00:00:45,216 --> 00:00:47,681
in hours, without a real fight.

22
00:00:48,292 --> 00:00:52,467
Duarte names Santiago Singh as the governor of Medina.

23
00:00:52,492 --> 00:00:54,697
Singh is a young Laconian officer

24
00:00:54,717 --> 00:00:56,242
who believes in order,

25
00:00:56,262 --> 00:00:58,337
and he wants to rule fairly.

26
00:00:58,402 --> 00:01:00,357
But when a bomb nearly kills him,

27
00:01:00,377 --> 00:01:01,932
he turns hard.

28
00:01:01,952 --> 00:01:05,867
Curfews, censorship, and public prisons follow.

29
00:01:05,922 --> 00:01:07,477
Every rule makes the people

30
00:01:07,497 --> 00:01:09,809
of Medina hate Laconia more.

31
00:01:10,556 --> 00:01:11,986
Singh hunts the underground,

32
00:01:12,006 --> 00:01:15,761
and he catches its most famous member: James Holden.

33
00:01:15,781 --> 00:01:18,411
Duarte orders Holden sent to Laconia

34
00:01:18,431 --> 00:01:19,706
as a prisoner.

35
00:01:19,871 --> 00:01:21,426
Singh hopes it will prove he can

36
00:01:21,446 --> 00:01:23,626
keep Medina under control.

37
00:01:23,646 --> 00:01:24,746
It doesn't.

38
00:01:24,846 --> 00:01:26,026
And in Laconia,

39
00:01:26,046 --> 00:01:27,656
failure has a price.

40
00:01:28,416 --> 00:01:30,571
Story two: Camina Drummer,

41
00:01:30,591 --> 00:01:32,991
president of the Transport Union.

42
00:01:33,046 --> 00:01:34,751
The Tempest goes through the Ring

43
00:01:34,771 --> 00:01:36,476
into the solar system.

44
00:01:36,496 --> 00:01:39,256
Earth, Mars, and the Union send everything

45
00:01:39,276 --> 00:01:40,726
they have against it.

46
00:01:40,751 --> 00:01:43,606
Even nuclear weapons barely scratch it.

47
00:01:43,626 --> 00:01:45,756
The combined fleet is wiped out.

48
00:01:46,389 --> 00:01:47,644
To save lives,

49
00:01:47,664 --> 00:01:50,929
Drummer surrenders, and Earth and Mars follow.

50
00:01:50,949 --> 00:01:53,129
Laconia lets her keep her job,

51
00:01:53,149 --> 00:01:54,254
so long as she does

52
00:01:54,274 --> 00:01:55,629
what she's told.

53
00:01:55,649 --> 00:01:57,979
Her husband Saba is still free,

54
00:01:57,999 --> 00:02:00,704
and he leads the resistance on Medina.

55
00:02:00,724 --> 00:02:02,804
Drummer has to smile for the cameras

56
00:02:02,824 --> 00:02:04,976
while secretly hoping he wins.

57
00:02:05,715 --> 00:02:08,295
Story three: the Rocinante.

58
00:02:08,315 --> 00:02:09,895
The crew is trapped on Medina

59
00:02:09,915 --> 00:02:10,770
when it falls,

60
00:02:10,790 --> 00:02:13,240
so they join Saba's resistance.

61
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,265
They plan a raid

62
00:02:14,285 --> 00:02:16,260
to steal Laconian codes,

63
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,855
using a staged bombing as cover.

64
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:19,915
The raid works,

65
00:02:19,935 --> 00:02:21,815
but Holden is captured.

66
00:02:21,835 --> 00:02:24,140
Now the resistance has one goal:

67
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,490
get as many ships out through

68
00:02:25,510 --> 00:02:27,105
the gates as they can.

69
00:02:27,761 --> 00:02:29,616
The breakout begins.

70
00:02:29,636 --> 00:02:31,291
Bobbie and her team capture

71
00:02:31,311 --> 00:02:32,841
a Laconian warship,

72
00:02:32,861 --> 00:02:34,541
the Gathering Storm.

73
00:02:34,561 --> 00:02:35,966
Clarissa uses the last

74
00:02:35,986 --> 00:02:38,266
of her old body modifications to stop

75
00:02:38,286 --> 00:02:40,766
an ambush, and it kills her.

76
00:02:40,786 --> 00:02:43,366
The Rocinante and a small fleet escape

77
00:02:43,386 --> 00:02:44,116
through the gates

78
00:02:44,136 --> 00:02:46,551
to a remote world called Freehold,

79
00:02:46,571 --> 00:02:48,528
and the resistance lives on.

80
00:02:49,187 --> 00:02:51,642
Book seven ends on Laconia.

81
00:02:51,662 --> 00:02:54,787
Singh is executed on Duarte's orders.

82
00:02:54,912 --> 00:02:56,992
Holden meets Duarte himself,

83
00:02:57,012 --> 00:02:59,167
who plans to use the protomolecule

84
00:02:59,187 --> 00:03:01,462
to rule humanity forever.

85
00:03:01,637 --> 00:03:03,717
Holden warns him about whatever killed

86
00:03:03,737 --> 00:03:04,727
the gate builders,

87
00:03:04,747 --> 00:03:06,927
but Duarte isn't listening.

88
00:03:06,947 --> 00:03:10,072
Next up: book eight, Tiamat's Wrath.

